## Why ShareAlike rather than a permissive licence

The entries were compiled to be honest about figures the industry routinely
overstates — that vending nets $50–150 a machine rather than the advertised
$300–600, that the median adult-subscription creator earns under $200 a month,
that craft brewing runs 4–9% net despite 80% gross margins.

ShareAlike means anyone reusing this dataset commercially must publish their
version under the same terms. That is deliberately unattractive to the
affiliate-funded sites this directory exists to be an alternative to, while
remaining fully open to researchers, educators, non-profits and anyone
building something they are willing to share back.

## Not advice

The dataset is educational information, not financial, tax or legal advice.
Figures are researched ranges reported by practitioners and platforms — they
are not promises, and most people land at the low end. Rules on tax, licensing,
insurance and permitted work vary by country and city.
